<title>ITALY: Italian M2 rose avge 8.3 pct in qtr end-April.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 rose avge 8.3 pct in qtr end-April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 grew an adjusted average 8.3 percent year-on-year in the three months to end-April compared with an average growth of 7.3 percent in the three months to end-March, the Bank of Italy said in a statement.</p>
</text>
